    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "Five shards, and every one of them is straining east. As if they are being called home."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "roxana",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "roxana",
      "text": "They are. The star wants to be whole again."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "roxana",
      "text": "Whoever wears it whole would not rule kings. He would rule every age that has ever had a king."
    },
