      "text": "Five shards, carried across five kingdoms, to my very door. Idris taught you well, boy."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "king",
      "text": "Climb my tower, castle-breaker. Bring me the pieces of my crown, and I will show you what your master truly was."
